WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
narrator: Bring up the local three-peer mesh.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:20.000
narrator: Read peer two and peer three's assigned tailnet addresses.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:35.000
narrator: Request peer one's ping to peer two and inspect the result.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:49.000
narrator: Repeat the ping toward peer three.

00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:05.000
narrator: Start a fixed HTTP responder on peer two.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:17.000
narrator: Send a GET through tailscale nc; this is peer traffic.

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:28.000
narrator: Read the admin policy; no paid settlement is exercised.

00:01:31.000 --> 00:01:38.000
narrator: Remove the local mesh.
